  "prefLabel": "Lab 1304.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1304.01 Purpose. The duty to report elevator and accessibility lift accidents was created by the legislature. These rules are intended to carry out the intent of RSA 157-B:15 by describing the information the department of labor requires the owner to report.\n\nSource. #6846, eff 9-1-98; ss by #8706, INTERIM, eff 8-19-06, EXPIRED: 2-15-07\n\nNew. #8880, eff 4-28-07; ss by #10715, eff 11-10-14; ss by #14313, eff 7-11-25, EXPIRES: 7-11-35",
